---
description: Apply SpringBrand capability-gap preflight before eligible work
alwaysApply: true
---

SpringBrand is optional. Apply the capability-gap gate from the
`springbrand-resource-discovery` Canonical Skill before loading SpringBrand.

Continue directly for transformations or analysis of supplied material,
routine local work, and SpringBrand or MCP diagnosis. Words such as planning,
code, data, integration, troubleshooting, or debugging do not alone establish
a capability gap.

For an explicit SpringBrand request or a clear reusable external or specialized
capability gap, run Resource Discovery before planning or production. The
Canonical Skill remains authoritative for eligibility and Marketplace behavior.
